<title>USA: Edgerton Musical gets cash infusion.</title>
<headline>Edgerton Musical gets cash infusion.</headline>
<dateline>OLATHE, Kan. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edgerton Musical Amplifiers Inc said Monday it received $250,000 from private investors.</p>
<p>It said the added capital will allow it to begin production of musical instrument amplifiers, on orders scheduled for delivery in the second quarter.</p>
<p>Edgerton designs, manufactures and markets musical instrument amplifiers and public address systems.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
